<p>Hi <%= @member.name %>,</p>

<p>A gentle reminder: we haven't heard from you yet for this WE Match round in <strong><%= @group.name %></strong>.</p>

<p>It's a chance to meet another woman in the group and learn from how she sees the world.</p>

<p>
  <a href="<%= @response_url %>">Share your availability</a>
</p>

<% if @closes_at.present? %>
  <p>Responses close <%= @closes_at.strftime("%A, %B %-d, %Y, %H:%M UTC") %>.</p>
<% end %>

<p>If this round isn't the right moment, you can simply let this email pass. We'll be glad to see you in a later one.</p>

<p>— WE Match</p>
